WEBVTT

00:00:02.083 --> 00:00:04.625
<c.Caption-C2_1>Ai, Ai, Ai, I love you!

00:00:04.750 --> 00:00:07.291
<c.Caption-C3_1>Mai, Mai, Mai, my darling!

00:00:07.416 --> 00:00:09.958
<c.Caption-C4_1>Mii, Mii, Mii, help me!

00:00:09.958 --> 00:00:14.333
<c.Caption-C5_1>Popotan! Popotan! Popotan!

00:00:28.708 --> 00:00:31.208
<c.Caption-C6_1>When you feel down

00:00:31.625 --> 00:00:34.083
<c.Caption-C7_1>And you are at your wit's end

00:00:34.458 --> 00:00:37.833
<c.Caption-C8_1>Ask the Popotan for advice

00:00:39.500 --> 00:00:42.000
<c.Caption-C9_1>Yes, if you can be honest

00:00:42.208 --> 00:00:44.708
<c.Caption-C10_1>And open up your heart

00:00:45.125 --> 00:00:48.958
<c.Caption-C11_1>The Popotan will show the way

00:00:49.291 --> 00:00:51.833
<c.Caption-C12_1>Will he come or not?

00:00:51.833 --> 00:00:54.541
<c.Caption-C13_1>Does he love me or not?

00:00:54.541 --> 00:00:57.166
<c.Caption-C14_1>Is this love true or false?

00:00:57.958 --> 00:01:02.208
<c.Caption-C15_1>They have all the answers

00:01:03.333 --> 00:01:05.583
<c.Caption-C16_1>I can't take it! Po po po!

00:01:05.916 --> 00:01:08.416
<c.Caption-C17_1>I can't take it! Po po po!

00:01:09.125 --> 00:01:13.916
<c.Caption-C18_1>I know, but I just can't stop!

00:01:14.125 --> 00:01:16.458
<c.Caption-C19_1>It's impossible! Po Po Po!

00:01:16.791 --> 00:01:18.875
<c.Caption-C20_1>It's impossible! Po Po Po!

00:01:19.791 --> 00:01:24.666
<c.Caption-C21_1>Even if it's just a dream, never give up!

00:01:24.708 --> 00:01:26.875
<c.Caption-C22_1>Popotan!

00:01:35.958 --> 00:01:37.000
<c.Subtitle-C2_1>I'm home.

00:01:39.833 --> 00:01:41.750
<c.Subtitle-C3_1>Welcome back, Daddy!

00:01:43.791 --> 00:01:45.208
<c.Subtitle-C4_1>Look! Look!

00:01:45.208 --> 00:01:46.625
<c.Subtitle-C5_1>What's this?

00:01:46.791 --> 00:01:50.750
<c.Subtitle-C6_1>It's a picture of her at

00:01:46.792 --> 00:01:50.750
<c.Subtitle-C6_2>the beach with a friend.

00:01:52.250 --> 00:01:54.500
<c.Subtitle-C7_1>Look. Isn't it pretty?

00:01:55.000 --> 00:01:57.291
<c.Subtitle-C8_1>It's really a lovely picture.

00:01:58.833 --> 00:02:00.041
<c.Subtitle-C9_1>What's the matter?

00:02:10.750 --> 00:02:11.958
<c.Subtitle-C10_1>This tree...

00:02:13.208 --> 00:02:18.125
<c.Caption-C23_1>Things That Cannot Be Said

00:02:20.500 --> 00:02:21.666
<c.Subtitle-C11_1>Ice cream!

00:02:21.750 --> 00:02:23.750
<c.Subtitle-C12_1>Magical Girl ice cream.

00:02:23.750 --> 00:02:24.291
<c.Subtitle-C13_1>Ice cream of love and justice!

00:02:24.291 --> 00:02:25.666
<c.Subtitle-C14_1>That's Lilo!

00:02:24.292 --> 00:02:25.666
<c.Subtitle-C14_2>Ice cream of love and justice!

00:02:25.666 --> 00:02:26.458
<c.Subtitle-C15_1>That's Lilo!

00:02:26.458 --> 00:02:27.916
<c.Subtitle-C16_1>Lilo? What do you mean?

00:02:27.916 --> 00:02:30.125
<c.Subtitle-C17_1>Don't you know?!

00:02:31.458 --> 00:02:35.000
<c.Subtitle-C18_1>She was the character in

00:02:31.459 --> 00:02:35.000
<c.Subtitle-C18_2>the TV series that ran...

00:02:35.000 --> 00:02:36.500
<c.Subtitle-C19_1>...one year from April 11, 1980.

00:02:36.500 --> 00:02:38.333
<c.Subtitle-C20_1>The production director

00:02:36.501 --> 00:02:38.333
<c.Subtitle-C20_2>was Seeta Fuefuki.

00:02:38.333 --> 00:02:41.375
<c.Subtitle-C21_1>At the time, it was

00:02:38.334 --> 00:02:41.375
<c.Subtitle-C21_2>Studio Belan's main work.

00:02:41.375 --> 00:02:44.500
<c.Subtitle-C22_1>The anime director of those sublime

00:02:41.376 --> 00:02:44.500
<c.Subtitle-C22_2>13 episodes was Oya Hiraya,

00:02:44.500 --> 00:02:49.625
<c.Subtitle-C23_1>who later went on to direct that series about

00:02:44.501 --> 00:02:49.625
<c.Subtitle-C23_2>the handsome super human "Coolman"!

00:02:49.625 --> 00:02:51.458
<c.Subtitle-C24_1>It's a famous program.

00:02:51.458 --> 00:02:52.958
<c.Subtitle-C25_1>What? You mean "the" Coolman?!

00:02:52.958 --> 00:02:55.500
<c.Subtitle-C26_1>Yes. The never-behind-the-times

00:02:52.959 --> 00:02:55.500
<c.Subtitle-C26_2>costume style.

00:02:55.500 --> 00:02:57.958
<c.Subtitle-C27_1>That show was so real!

00:02:58.000 --> 00:02:59.166
<c.Subtitle-C28_1>In any case...

00:02:59.208 --> 00:03:02.041
<c.Subtitle-C29_1>Excuse me!

00:02:59.209 --> 00:03:02.041
<c.Subtitle-C29_2>One rum and raisin please!

00:03:02.041 --> 00:03:04.500
<c.Subtitle-C30_1>Uh, me too!

00:03:02.042 --> 00:03:04.500
<c.Subtitle-C30_2>I'll have a chocolate mint!

00:03:04.750 --> 00:03:05.708
<c.Subtitle-C31_1>Okay!

00:03:05.708 --> 00:03:08.833
<c.Subtitle-C32_1>Mai, I need a hand!

00:03:08.833 --> 00:03:10.875
<c.Subtitle-C33_1>Isn't Ai coming?

00:03:11.250 --> 00:03:13.541
<c.Subtitle-C34_1>I'm sure she'll be here soon.

00:03:13.541 --> 00:03:17.041
<c.Subtitle-C35_1>But we sure ended up

00:03:13.542 --> 00:03:17.041
<c.Subtitle-C35_2>in a lively place.

00:03:18.291 --> 00:03:19.625
<c.Caption-C24_1>Beach House

00:03:18.292 --> 00:03:19.625
<c.Caption-C24_2>Popotan

00:03:18.293 --> 00:03:19.625
<c.Caption-C24_3>Merry Popotan

00:03:25.041 --> 00:03:26.791
<c.Subtitle-C36_1>Can I have an ice cream?

00:03:26.791 --> 00:03:28.166
<c.Subtitle-C37_1>Let's see...

00:03:28.208 --> 00:03:30.875
<c.Subtitle-C38_1>Would you like a single, or a double?

00:03:30.875 --> 00:03:32.541
<c.Subtitle-C39_1>We also do "specials".

00:03:32.833 --> 00:03:34.083
<c.Subtitle-C40_1>Specials?

00:03:34.083 --> 00:03:36.791
<c.Subtitle-C41_1>I'll take that if you give me

00:03:34.084 --> 00:03:36.791
<c.Subtitle-C41_2>something extra.

00:03:36.791 --> 00:03:38.625
<c.Subtitle-C42_1>Sure. Coming right up.

00:03:52.166 --> 00:03:53.666
<c.Subtitle-C43_1>So, how much is it?

00:03:54.458 --> 00:03:58.791
<c.Subtitle-C44_1>Sir, if you want to make this

00:03:54.459 --> 00:03:58.791
<c.Subtitle-C44_2>a "super special"...

00:03:58.791 --> 00:04:01.125
<c.Subtitle-C45_1>...I can give you even more extra.

00:04:01.125 --> 00:04:02.208
<c.Subtitle-C46_1>Super?

00:04:06.666 --> 00:04:10.541
<c.Subtitle-C47_1>What will it be?

00:04:06.667 --> 00:04:10.541
<c.Subtitle-C47_2>The super special?

00:04:10.541 --> 00:04:12.333
<c.Subtitle-C48_1>Uh, I'll take that.

00:04:12.333 --> 00:04:13.833
<c.Subtitle-C49_1>That'll be 10,000 yen.

00:04:14.250 --> 00:04:15.458
<c.Subtitle-C50_1>10,000?

00:04:16.666 --> 00:04:18.041
<c.Subtitle-C51_1>Thank you.

00:04:18.333 --> 00:04:20.666
<c.Subtitle-C52_1>Here are your "super" extras.

00:04:23.916 --> 00:04:25.416
<c.Subtitle-C53_1>Just stay down there and be quiet.

00:04:25.125 --> 00:04:28.083
<c.Caption-C25_1>Beach House

00:04:25.126 --> 00:04:28.083
<c.Caption-C25_2>Popotan

00:04:25.127 --> 00:04:28.083
<c.Caption-C25_3>Merry Popotan

00:04:29.625 --> 00:04:32.000
<c.Subtitle-C54_1>Well that sure took some time.

00:04:33.041 --> 00:04:35.458
<c.Subtitle-C55_1>Mea, would you like to switch?

00:04:35.750 --> 00:04:36.375
<c.Subtitle-C56_1>No.

00:04:36.375 --> 00:04:40.208
<c.Subtitle-C57_1>Miss Mai told me that I must not

00:04:36.376 --> 00:04:40.208
<c.Subtitle-C57_2>under any circumstances.

00:04:40.666 --> 00:04:42.166
<c.Subtitle-C58_1>I see...

00:04:43.916 --> 00:04:47.208
<c.Subtitle-C59_1>But I've gotten better recently.

00:04:47.250 --> 00:04:49.708
<c.Subtitle-C60_1>Those are Miss Mai's strict orders.

00:04:55.958 --> 00:04:57.583
<c.Subtitle-C61_1>What a surprise.

00:05:00.583 --> 00:05:02.416
<c.Subtitle-C62_1>It's Ai, isn't it?

00:05:02.791 --> 00:05:04.583
<c.Subtitle-C63_1>And who may you be?

00:05:04.916 --> 00:05:06.833
<c.Subtitle-C64_1>Daichi. It's Daichi!

00:05:07.125 --> 00:05:08.500
<c.Subtitle-C65_1>Daichi?

00:05:32.500 --> 00:05:35.625
<c.Subtitle-C66_1>The house looked familiar,

00:05:32.501 --> 00:05:35.625
<c.Subtitle-C66_2>so I came to check it out.

00:05:35.625 --> 00:05:38.125
<c.Subtitle-C67_1>I never thought you'd be here.

00:05:39.166 --> 00:05:43.916
<c.Subtitle-C68_1>Moreover, the house looks

00:05:39.167 --> 00:05:43.916
<c.Subtitle-C68_2>exactly like it did back then.

00:05:44.541 --> 00:05:47.875
<c.Subtitle-C69_1>And you haven't changed at all.

00:05:48.500 --> 00:05:51.541
<c.Subtitle-C70_1>I think that was when I was

00:05:48.501 --> 00:05:51.541
<c.Subtitle-C70_2>in grade school...

00:05:51.583 --> 00:05:53.583
<c.Subtitle-C71_1>...so it must've been about

00:05:51.584 --> 00:05:53.583
<c.Subtitle-C71_2>30 years ago...

00:05:56.791 --> 00:05:57.666
<c.Subtitle-C72_1>Aya...

00:06:01.000 --> 00:06:03.333
<c.Subtitle-C73_1>Aya? What's the matter?

00:06:04.500 --> 00:06:05.500
<c.Subtitle-C74_1>Huh?

00:06:06.625 --> 00:06:07.625
<c.Subtitle-C75_1>Aya?

00:06:10.958 --> 00:06:12.416
<c.Subtitle-C76_1>Uh, yes.

00:06:12.416 --> 00:06:14.916
<c.Subtitle-C77_1>My name is actually Aya.

00:06:15.458 --> 00:06:17.791
<c.Subtitle-C78_1>You've got the wrong person.

00:06:17.791 --> 00:06:19.166
<c.Subtitle-C79_1>Aya, let's go.

00:06:19.166 --> 00:06:21.333
<c.Subtitle-C80_1>Uh, sure...

00:06:23.125 --> 00:06:26.083
<c.Subtitle-C81_1>Uh, but... Wait!

00:06:57.541 --> 00:06:59.208
<c.Subtitle-C82_1>What beautiful eyes.

00:07:00.208 --> 00:07:02.166
<c.Subtitle-C83_1>It looks like he's gone.

00:07:02.791 --> 00:07:04.916
<c.Subtitle-C84_1>Uh, who are you?

00:07:04.916 --> 00:07:06.375
<c.Subtitle-C85_1>I'm Keith.

00:07:06.750 --> 00:07:09.083
<c.Subtitle-C86_1>Sorry to barge in like that.

00:07:09.083 --> 00:07:11.583
<c.Subtitle-C87_1>It looked like you were in trouble, so I...

00:07:12.333 --> 00:07:14.250
<c.Subtitle-C88_1>Thank you.

00:07:14.250 --> 00:07:15.583
<c.Subtitle-C89_1>Who was he?

00:07:27.333 --> 00:07:28.833
<c.Subtitle-C90_1>Uh, um...

00:07:30.875 --> 00:07:32.000
<c.Subtitle-C91_1>It's all right.

00:07:32.000 --> 00:07:33.041
<c.Subtitle-C92_1>What?

00:07:33.083 --> 00:07:35.875
<c.Subtitle-C93_1>We all have things we don't talk about.

00:07:36.250 --> 00:07:38.750
<c.Subtitle-C94_1>I'm not going to force it.

00:07:38.791 --> 00:07:39.875
<c.Subtitle-C95_1>Keith...

00:07:41.041 --> 00:07:44.041
<c.Subtitle-C96_1>This is very cute. Can I have one?

00:07:51.416 --> 00:07:52.625
<c.Subtitle-C97_1>That was exhausting.

00:07:52.625 --> 00:07:54.958
<c.Subtitle-C98_1>So Ai didn't bother at all today.

00:07:54.958 --> 00:07:55.458
<c.Subtitle-C99_1>We'll have to give her hell.

00:07:55.458 --> 00:07:55.958
<c.Subtitle-C100_1>Thanks very much.

00:07:55.459 --> 00:07:55.958
<c.Subtitle-C100_2>We'll have to give her hell.

00:07:55.958 --> 00:07:56.958
<c.Subtitle-C101_1>Thanks very much.

00:07:58.625 --> 00:07:59.666
<c.Subtitle-C102_1>Ai?

00:07:59.666 --> 00:08:02.333
<c.Subtitle-C103_1>Hey! Wow! Who's that man?

00:08:10.875 --> 00:08:11.958
<c.Subtitle-C104_1>Hey!

00:08:11.958 --> 00:08:15.208
<c.Subtitle-C105_1>They're kissing! They're kissing!

00:08:18.708 --> 00:08:19.875
<c.Subtitle-C106_1>Goodbye.

00:08:26.583 --> 00:08:28.250
<c.Subtitle-C107_1>Daichi came?

00:08:28.333 --> 00:08:30.833
<c.Subtitle-C108_1>You mean Puffy Cheeks?!

00:08:31.250 --> 00:08:33.000
<c.Subtitle-C109_1>I want to poke him in the cheeks!

00:08:33.041 --> 00:08:36.083
<c.Subtitle-C110_1>I doubt that Daichi would

00:08:33.042 --> 00:08:36.083
<c.Subtitle-C110_2>have puffy cheeks now.

00:08:36.083 --> 00:08:37.000
<c.Subtitle-C111_1>What?!

00:08:37.000 --> 00:08:40.583
<c.Subtitle-C112_1>And so this Keith guy came

00:08:37.001 --> 00:08:40.583
<c.Subtitle-C112_2>and saved the day?

00:08:40.583 --> 00:08:41.583
<c.Subtitle-C113_1>Yes.

00:08:43.708 --> 00:08:46.375
<c.Subtitle-C114_1>So how did that end up with a kiss?

00:08:46.375 --> 00:08:48.041
<c.Subtitle-C115_1>I think that was...

00:08:51.583 --> 00:08:54.500
<c.Subtitle-C116_1>I think that was like a greeting.

00:08:55.083 --> 00:08:57.625
<c.Subtitle-C117_1>I don't think it was a big deal.

00:09:01.916 --> 00:09:03.583
<c.Subtitle-C118_1>Greeting, huh?

00:09:04.791 --> 00:09:06.958
<c.Subtitle-C119_1>There's nothing to be concerned about.

00:09:06.958 --> 00:09:08.583
<c.Subtitle-C120_1>There's no harm done.

00:09:08.791 --> 00:09:11.500
<c.Subtitle-C121_1>You seem to be distracted by it.

00:09:12.125 --> 00:09:14.000
<c.Subtitle-C122_1>Y-You think?

00:09:16.125 --> 00:09:17.125
<c.Subtitle-C123_1>Oh, my!

00:09:18.125 --> 00:09:21.291
<c.Subtitle-C124_1>It's fine if he sees it as a greeting, too.

00:09:22.083 --> 00:09:25.166
<c.Subtitle-C125_1>But I sometimes worry

00:09:22.084 --> 00:09:25.166
<c.Subtitle-C125_2>about your naïveté.

00:09:25.375 --> 00:09:28.958
<c.Subtitle-C126_1>And sometimes I worry about

00:09:25.376 --> 00:09:28.958
<c.Subtitle-C126_2>the size of your boobs, Mai!

00:09:29.916 --> 00:09:32.958
<c.Subtitle-C127_1>Ow! Ow! Ow!

00:09:29.917 --> 00:09:32.958
<c.Subtitle-C127_2>Shut up!

00:09:37.833 --> 00:09:39.916
<c.Subtitle-C128_1>Daddy, what is that?

00:09:41.000 --> 00:09:44.000
<c.Subtitle-C129_1>Some treasures from when I was a kid.

00:09:44.000 --> 00:09:45.833
<c.Subtitle-C130_1>Your grandma sent it to me.

00:09:46.083 --> 00:09:48.291
<c.Subtitle-C131_1>Why did you want that

00:09:46.084 --> 00:09:48.291
<c.Subtitle-C131_2>all of a sudden?

00:09:48.291 --> 00:09:50.208
<c.Subtitle-C132_1>There was something that

00:09:48.292 --> 00:09:50.208
<c.Subtitle-C132_2>was concerning me.

00:09:51.625 --> 00:09:52.625
<c.Subtitle-C133_1>There.

00:09:53.583 --> 00:09:54.750
<c.Subtitle-C134_1>So similar...

00:09:55.041 --> 00:09:57.041
<c.Subtitle-C135_1>No, they're not merely similar.

00:09:57.666 --> 00:10:01.166
<c.Subtitle-C136_1>The house, clothes, face,

00:09:57.667 --> 00:10:01.166
<c.Subtitle-C136_2>everything is the same.

00:10:02.500 --> 00:10:04.500
<c.Subtitle-C137_1>Oh, my. I haven't seen that in a while.

00:10:04.500 --> 00:10:09.250
<c.Subtitle-C138_1>Isn't that the house that disappeared

00:10:04.501 --> 00:10:09.250
<c.Subtitle-C138_2>before your eyes in a puff of smoke?

00:10:10.333 --> 00:10:11.416
<c.Subtitle-C139_1>Disappeared?

00:10:51.833 --> 00:10:56.625
<c.Subtitle-C140_1>I suggested that it was probably a dream,

00:10:51.834 --> 00:10:56.625
<c.Subtitle-C140_2>but you refused to believe that.

00:10:57.375 --> 00:10:59.708
<c.Subtitle-C141_1>You were so stubborn, even back then.

00:11:00.375 --> 00:11:01.375
<c.Subtitle-C142_1>No way...

00:11:03.750 --> 00:11:05.916
<c.Subtitle-C143_1>How can I help you?

00:11:06.041 --> 00:11:08.791
<c.Subtitle-C144_1>I have an arrangement with Ai.

00:11:08.833 --> 00:11:11.500
<c.Subtitle-C145_1>I haven't heard of any such thing.

00:11:11.708 --> 00:11:13.208
<c.Subtitle-C146_1>It's okay, Mea.

00:11:13.791 --> 00:11:18.500
<c.Subtitle-C147_1>Keith is here to show me

00:11:13.792 --> 00:11:18.500
<c.Subtitle-C147_2>where I can find some Popotan.

00:11:26.250 --> 00:11:27.250
<c.Subtitle-C148_1>Yes?

00:11:30.791 --> 00:11:32.291
<c.Subtitle-C149_1>Is that right?

00:11:34.041 --> 00:11:36.416
<c.Subtitle-C150_1>Did you get any information?

00:11:36.416 --> 00:11:37.833
<c.Subtitle-C151_1>Unfortunately not.

00:11:37.916 --> 00:11:39.875
<c.Subtitle-C152_1>Then let's go somewhere else.

00:11:40.916 --> 00:11:41.916
<c.Subtitle-C153_1>Um...

00:11:44.291 --> 00:11:46.333
<c.Subtitle-C154_1>Don't you find this strange?

00:11:47.750 --> 00:11:48.791
<c.Subtitle-C155_1>What?

00:11:49.416 --> 00:11:55.000
<c.Subtitle-C156_1>Well, most people would find it strange

00:11:49.417 --> 00:11:55.000
<c.Subtitle-C156_2>that I can hear flowers speak.

00:11:55.541 --> 00:11:56.750
<c.Subtitle-C157_1>Not at all.

00:11:56.750 --> 00:11:58.666
<c.Subtitle-C158_1>I mean, flowers are alive.

00:11:59.083 --> 00:12:02.083
<c.Subtitle-C159_1>I don't think it's strange that

00:11:59.084 --> 00:12:02.083
<c.Subtitle-C159_2>you can hear their voices.

00:12:07.375 --> 00:12:08.458
<c.Subtitle-C160_1>Right.

00:12:12.625 --> 00:12:14.541
<c.Subtitle-C161_1>I finally get to see a smile.

00:12:14.541 --> 00:12:15.500
<c.Subtitle-C162_1>Huh?

00:12:15.500 --> 00:12:20.125
<c.Subtitle-C163_1>When I first saw you,

00:12:15.501 --> 00:12:20.125
<c.Subtitle-C163_2>you seemed kind of sad.

00:12:20.666 --> 00:12:21.750
<c.Subtitle-C164_1>Keith...

00:12:22.166 --> 00:12:25.791
<c.Subtitle-C165_1>I thought a kiss would brighten

00:12:22.167 --> 00:12:25.791
<c.Subtitle-C165_2>you up, but it didn't work.

00:12:25.791 --> 00:12:26.875
<c.Subtitle-C166_1>I'm sorry.

00:12:26.875 --> 00:12:29.166
<c.Subtitle-C167_1>No. I should apologize.

00:12:29.166 --> 00:12:32.000
<c.Subtitle-C168_1>I'm sorry to make you so worried.

00:12:34.875 --> 00:12:37.291
<c.Subtitle-C169_1>You can talk to me about anything.

00:12:41.041 --> 00:12:43.541
<c.Subtitle-C170_1>If you feel like talking,

00:12:41.042 --> 00:12:43.541
<c.Subtitle-C170_2>I'm here for you.

00:12:46.541 --> 00:12:48.416
<c.Subtitle-C171_1>Oh, I'm fine.

00:12:48.666 --> 00:12:49.750
<c.Subtitle-C172_1>Let's go.

00:12:57.958 --> 00:12:59.208
<c.Subtitle-C173_1>Popotan.

00:13:02.833 --> 00:13:03.958
<c.Subtitle-C174_1>Popotan.

00:13:12.583 --> 00:13:14.208
<c.Caption-C26_1>Satellite Image Bank

00:13:14.375 --> 00:13:17.000
<c.Subtitle-C175_1>So, thirty years ago...

00:13:17.250 --> 00:13:18.750
<c.Caption-C27_1>Searching year...

00:13:23.625 --> 00:13:26.083
<c.Subtitle-C176_1>This is the school.

00:13:27.750 --> 00:13:28.750
<c.Subtitle-C177_1>So there it is...

00:13:29.250 --> 00:13:30.958
<c.Subtitle-C178_1>And the year before that...

00:13:34.500 --> 00:13:35.500
<c.Subtitle-C179_1>Nothing.

00:13:49.083 --> 00:13:51.250
<c.Subtitle-C180_1>Nothing a year ago in this location.

00:13:52.166 --> 00:13:54.000
<c.Subtitle-C181_1>That house must've been...

00:13:59.541 --> 00:14:01.458
<c.Subtitle-C182_1>Ow! Ow!

00:14:01.458 --> 00:14:03.500
<c.Subtitle-C183_1>It hurts!

00:14:01.459 --> 00:14:03.500
<c.Subtitle-C183_2>Just take it easy!

00:14:03.500 --> 00:14:06.916
<c.Subtitle-C184_1>But my sunburn really hurts!

00:14:07.208 --> 00:14:11.083
<c.Subtitle-C185_1>Ai's much gentler with me!

00:14:11.125 --> 00:14:12.958
<c.Subtitle-C186_1>You'll just have to put up with it.

00:14:12.958 --> 00:14:15.125
<c.Subtitle-C187_1>Ai is having a talk with Keith.

00:14:15.708 --> 00:14:17.458
<c.Subtitle-C188_1>What kind of talk?

00:14:17.458 --> 00:14:18.583
<c.Subtitle-C189_1>I wonder, I wonder...

00:14:18.583 --> 00:14:19.666
<c.Subtitle-C190_1>Who knows?

00:14:20.041 --> 00:14:22.083
<c.Subtitle-C191_1>You think they're breaking up?

00:14:22.083 --> 00:14:24.916
<c.Subtitle-C192_1>I don't think it's any of your concern.

00:14:25.875 --> 00:14:27.458
<c.Subtitle-C193_1>That stings!

00:14:28.541 --> 00:14:32.291
<c.Subtitle-C194_1>But I thought Ai would be

00:14:28.542 --> 00:14:32.291
<c.Subtitle-C194_2>a little surer of herself than this.

00:14:32.291 --> 00:14:33.958
<c.Subtitle-C195_1>She doesn't seem herself.

00:14:34.250 --> 00:14:36.333
<c.Subtitle-C196_1>She's probably lonely.

00:14:36.333 --> 00:14:37.666
<c.Subtitle-C197_1>I'm sure.

00:14:39.500 --> 00:14:42.583
<c.Subtitle-C198_1>Don't be so precocious.

00:14:48.708 --> 00:14:50.041
<c.Subtitle-C199_1>Moving?

00:14:50.041 --> 00:14:53.708
<c.Subtitle-C200_1>Yes. So, I'm sorry we can't...

00:14:55.000 --> 00:14:56.333
<c.Subtitle-C201_1>I see.

00:15:00.291 --> 00:15:01.375
<c.Subtitle-C202_1>Keith...

00:15:03.958 --> 00:15:06.125
<c.Subtitle-C203_1>Thanks for everything the past few days.

00:15:07.041 --> 00:15:08.625
<c.Subtitle-C204_1>It's been a lot of fun.

00:15:12.791 --> 00:15:14.125
<c.Subtitle-C205_1>Please wait!

00:15:15.791 --> 00:15:17.333
<c.Subtitle-C206_1>I'm sorry.

00:15:17.333 --> 00:15:19.458
<c.Subtitle-C207_1>You've been so concerned about me...

00:15:19.458 --> 00:15:22.375
<c.Subtitle-C208_1>...and I just couldn't open up

00:15:19.459 --> 00:15:22.375
<c.Subtitle-C208_2>to you in the end.

00:15:23.375 --> 00:15:24.916
<c.Subtitle-C209_1>Don't worry about it.

00:15:25.208 --> 00:15:27.166
<c.Subtitle-C210_1>It's not your fault at all.

00:15:28.375 --> 00:15:31.250
<c.Subtitle-C211_1>I really want to tell you everything.

00:15:31.583 --> 00:15:34.708
<c.Subtitle-C212_1>But, I just can't.

00:15:39.458 --> 00:15:41.041
<c.Subtitle-C213_1>I just can't.

00:15:43.708 --> 00:15:46.000
<c.Subtitle-C214_1>It's okay. Don't force yourself.

00:15:47.666 --> 00:15:48.958
<c.Subtitle-C215_1>Keith...

00:15:50.083 --> 00:15:52.625
<c.Subtitle-C216_1>You don't have to tell me anything.

00:15:57.750 --> 00:15:59.583
<c.Subtitle-C217_1>The way I feel about you...

00:16:20.250 --> 00:16:21.708
<c.Subtitle-C218_1>That was easy.

00:16:24.333 --> 00:16:27.083
<c.Subtitle-C219_1>This is your share.

00:16:49.958 --> 00:16:51.000
<c.Subtitle-C220_1>You...

00:16:51.000 --> 00:16:52.625
<c.Subtitle-C221_1>What do you want?

00:16:56.000 --> 00:16:59.541
<c.Subtitle-C222_1>It was really bothering me,

00:16:56.001 --> 00:16:59.541
<c.Subtitle-C222_2>so I came to check it out.

00:16:59.541 --> 00:17:02.875
<c.Subtitle-C223_1>The people I met 30 years ago

00:16:59.542 --> 00:17:02.875
<c.Subtitle-C223_2>haven't changed.

00:17:02.875 --> 00:17:05.583
<c.Subtitle-C224_1>And the house, too.

00:17:02.876 --> 00:17:05.583
<c.Subtitle-C224_2>I want to know why this is here.

00:17:05.583 --> 00:17:07.416
<c.Subtitle-C225_1>What are you talking about?

00:17:07.416 --> 00:17:09.083
<c.Subtitle-C226_1>I looked into it.

00:17:09.291 --> 00:17:13.083
<c.Subtitle-C227_1>One year ago there was no trace

00:17:09.292 --> 00:17:13.083
<c.Subtitle-C227_2>whatsoever of this house here.

00:17:13.083 --> 00:17:16.416
<c.Subtitle-C228_1>The house I saw 30 years ago

00:17:13.084 --> 00:17:16.416
<c.Subtitle-C228_2>also didn't exist the year before.

00:17:16.916 --> 00:17:20.791
<c.Subtitle-C229_1>If I look into it more closely,

00:17:16.917 --> 00:17:20.791
<c.Subtitle-C229_2>I'm sure it'll become clearer.

00:17:20.791 --> 00:17:24.833
<c.Subtitle-C230_1>This house and the people

00:17:20.792 --> 00:17:24.833
<c.Subtitle-C230_2>who live here...

00:17:24.833 --> 00:17:27.000
<c.Subtitle-C231_1>...traveled across time

00:17:24.834 --> 00:17:27.000
<c.Subtitle-C231_2>from 30 years ago.

00:17:28.583 --> 00:17:30.083
<c.Subtitle-C232_1>Let me see Ai.

00:17:30.291 --> 00:17:31.625
<c.Subtitle-C233_1>If I can talk to her...

00:17:53.958 --> 00:17:55.625
<c.Subtitle-C234_1>Who is he?!

00:18:11.708 --> 00:18:13.041
<c.Subtitle-C235_1>What's going on?

00:18:13.791 --> 00:18:16.416
<c.Subtitle-C236_1>You'll get hurt if you get in the way.

00:18:17.250 --> 00:18:18.750
<c.Subtitle-C237_1>I wonder about that.

00:18:25.750 --> 00:18:27.125
<c.Subtitle-C238_1>Mii, you stay inside!

00:18:28.000 --> 00:18:29.208
<c.Subtitle-C239_1>But, Ai...!

00:18:30.083 --> 00:18:31.333
<c.Subtitle-C240_1>Surprise...

00:18:33.541 --> 00:18:34.416
<c.Subtitle-C241_1>Sorry.

00:18:34.416 --> 00:18:35.250
<c.Subtitle-C242_1>Darn!

00:18:40.708 --> 00:18:44.375
<c.Subtitle-C243_1>I don't want to hurt you people.

00:18:40.709 --> 00:18:44.375
<c.Subtitle-C243_2>So, please!

00:18:44.375 --> 00:18:45.416
<c.Subtitle-C244_1>Mai!

00:18:45.416 --> 00:18:46.541
<c.Subtitle-C245_1>Mea!

00:18:49.375 --> 00:18:53.083
<c.Subtitle-C246_1>There are things in this world that

00:18:49.376 --> 00:18:53.083
<c.Subtitle-C246_2>you're not supposed to know.

00:19:04.458 --> 00:19:05.416
<c.Subtitle-C247_1>Ai...

00:19:05.500 --> 00:19:07.291
<c.Subtitle-C248_1>Who are you, anyway?

00:19:08.958 --> 00:19:10.291
<c.Subtitle-C249_1>Please move out of the way.

00:19:10.291 --> 00:19:13.791
<c.Subtitle-C250_1>If you let him live, you will not

00:19:10.292 --> 00:19:13.791
<c.Subtitle-C250_2>be able to continue your journey.

00:19:15.166 --> 00:19:16.833
<c.Subtitle-C251_1>You knew?

00:19:17.083 --> 00:19:18.083
<c.Subtitle-C252_1>Yes.

00:19:18.083 --> 00:19:21.041
<c.Subtitle-C253_1>So it was all an act,

00:19:18.084 --> 00:19:21.041
<c.Subtitle-C253_2>right from the beginning.

00:19:24.416 --> 00:19:26.291
<c.Subtitle-C254_1>You seemed to enjoy it.

00:19:32.291 --> 00:19:33.500
<c.Subtitle-C255_1>Don't ever...

00:19:33.500 --> 00:19:36.041
<c.Subtitle-C256_1>Don't you ever appear in front

00:19:33.501 --> 00:19:36.041
<c.Subtitle-C256_2>of me again, please!

00:19:41.000 --> 00:19:42.208
<c.Subtitle-C257_1>Are you sure?

00:19:42.208 --> 00:19:46.500
<c.Subtitle-C258_1>If you let him live,

00:19:42.209 --> 00:19:46.500
<c.Subtitle-C258_2>he'll leave evidence.

00:19:46.500 --> 00:19:48.833
<c.Subtitle-C259_1>And someone who has

00:19:46.501 --> 00:19:48.833
<c.Subtitle-C259_2>seen the evidence...

00:19:48.833 --> 00:19:52.083
<c.Subtitle-C260_1>...will come after you, whatever

00:19:48.834 --> 00:19:52.083
<c.Subtitle-C260_2>time you happen to be in.

00:19:53.500 --> 00:19:54.958
<c.Subtitle-C261_1>If you don't like that...

00:19:54.958 --> 00:19:56.083
<c.Subtitle-C262_1>It's fine with me.

00:19:58.208 --> 00:20:02.166
<c.Subtitle-C263_1>Whether we reunite with the same person

00:19:58.209 --> 00:20:02.166
<c.Subtitle-C263_2>or meet someone we really like...

00:20:02.166 --> 00:20:04.666
<c.Subtitle-C264_1>...we'll never be able to

00:20:02.167 --> 00:20:04.666
<c.Subtitle-C264_2>tell them our story.

00:20:05.458 --> 00:20:07.958
<c.Subtitle-C265_1>It's the same as not being alive!

00:20:08.416 --> 00:20:12.541
<c.Subtitle-C266_1>So, we are not in a position to

00:20:08.417 --> 00:20:12.541
<c.Subtitle-C266_2>stop someone else from living!

00:20:12.541 --> 00:20:13.708
<c.Subtitle-C267_1>Definitely not!

00:20:15.750 --> 00:20:17.208
<c.Subtitle-C268_1>I understand.

00:20:17.208 --> 00:20:19.333
<c.Subtitle-C269_1>If you feel that strongly about it.

00:20:19.791 --> 00:20:21.041
<c.Subtitle-C270_1>However...

00:20:27.333 --> 00:20:29.666
<c.Subtitle-C271_1>One day you'll understand.

00:20:53.250 --> 00:20:54.708
<c.Subtitle-C272_1>You'll be okay now.

00:20:56.833 --> 00:21:00.041
<c.Subtitle-C273_1>Now, Mai wants us back

00:20:56.834 --> 00:21:00.041
<c.Subtitle-C273_2>as soon as possible.

00:21:00.458 --> 00:21:01.875
<c.Subtitle-C274_1>All right.

00:21:04.958 --> 00:21:05.833
<c.Subtitle-C275_1>I'm sorry.

00:21:06.083 --> 00:21:08.208
<c.Subtitle-C276_1>No. I should be the one to apologize.

00:21:10.208 --> 00:21:11.291
<c.Subtitle-C277_1>Um...

00:21:12.125 --> 00:21:13.375
<c.Subtitle-C278_1>You don't have to tell me.

00:21:13.375 --> 00:21:14.291
<c.Subtitle-C279_1>What?

00:21:15.458 --> 00:21:16.041
<c.Caption-C28_1>Pictures Deleted

00:21:19.541 --> 00:21:20.666
<c.Subtitle-C280_1>Daichi...

00:21:21.958 --> 00:21:24.583
<c.Subtitle-C281_1>One day when you're able to talk...

00:21:24.583 --> 00:21:26.416
<c.Subtitle-C282_1>...maybe you can tell me your story.

00:21:28.333 --> 00:21:29.833
<c.Subtitle-C283_1>I'll be waiting until then.

00:21:31.000 --> 00:21:31.666
<c.Subtitle-C284_1>Okay!

00:21:51.458 --> 00:21:54.625
<c.Subtitle-C285_1>I'm sure we'll meet again someday.

00:22:11.916 --> 00:22:15.333
<c.Caption-C29_1>I want to love you in technopunk

00:22:15.333 --> 00:22:18.708
<c.Caption-C30_1>I transmit my love through the airwaves

00:22:18.708 --> 00:22:22.250
<c.Caption-C31_1>I want to be romantic with you

00:22:22.250 --> 00:22:23.791
<c.Caption-C32_1>I want you to laugh

00:22:23.791 --> 00:22:25.541
<c.Caption-C33_1>I love, love, love you

00:22:25.541 --> 00:22:29.000
<c.Caption-C34_1>S.U.K.I. Thump thump love

00:22:29.000 --> 00:22:32.500
<c.Caption-C35_1>S.U.K.I. Gimme gimme kiss

00:22:32.500 --> 00:22:36.000
<c.Caption-C36_1>S.U.K.I. Suki suki love

00:22:36.000 --> 00:22:39.625
<c.Caption-C37_1>S.U.K.I. You love me? Kiss

00:22:39.625 --> 00:22:41.375
<c.Caption-C38_1>Round and round

00:22:41.375 --> 00:22:43.125
<c.Caption-C39_1>The needle of the time-space clock

00:22:43.125 --> 00:22:46.583
<c.Caption-C40_1>Points to our star charts

00:22:46.583 --> 00:22:49.916
<c.Caption-C41_1>The secret of love is revealed

00:22:49.916 --> 00:22:54.541
<c.Caption-C42_1>I want to know more about

00:22:49.917 --> 00:22:54.541
<c.Caption-C42_2>what makes my heart go thump thump

00:22:56.791 --> 00:23:01.416
<c.Caption-C43_1>If every boy and every girl

00:22:56.792 --> 00:23:01.416
<c.Caption-C43_2>believed in miracles

00:23:03.625 --> 00:23:08.375
<c.Caption-C44_1>We'd be sure to find

00:23:03.626 --> 00:23:08.375
<c.Caption-C44_2>the berry, berry strawberry day

00:23:10.708 --> 00:23:16.750
<c.Caption-C45_1>I'll be fine even if we have to

00:23:10.709 --> 00:23:16.750
<c.Caption-C45_2>say goodbye one day

00:23:16.791 --> 00:23:21.500
<c.Caption-C46_1>I still want to tell you just how I love you

00:23:21.541 --> 00:23:24.666
<c.Caption-C47_1>I love you! I, I love you!

00:23:26.375 --> 00:23:30.000
<c.Subtitle-C286_1>Transform! Una!

00:23:41.083 --> 00:23:44.708
<c.Subtitle-C287_1>Well, was I cute in that episode?

00:23:46.041 --> 00:24:03.291
<c.Caption-C48_1>Christmas

00:23:46.666 --> 00:23:49.666
<c.Subtitle-C288_1>Okay, the next episode of

00:23:46.667 --> 00:23:49.666
<c.Subtitle-C288_2>Popotan is "Christmas".

00:23:49.666 --> 00:23:51.583
<c.Subtitle-C289_1>Outside is a world of silver.

00:23:51.583 --> 00:23:55.750
<c.Subtitle-C290_1>In the cold, the only sure thing

00:23:51.584 --> 00:23:55.750
<c.Subtitle-C290_2>is the warmth of your lover!

00:23:56.041 --> 00:23:58.083
<c.Subtitle-C291_1>I'm sorry. That's not true.

00:23:58.083 --> 00:24:00.458
<c.Subtitle-C292_1>It's actually unusually hot this autumn!

00:24:00.458 --> 00:24:01.583
<c.Subtitle-C293_1>It's freezing!

00:24:01.583 --> 00:24:03.583
<c.Subtitle-C294_1>Do you feel a little cooler?

00:24:07.500 --> 00:24:09.666
<c.Subtitle-C295_1>Good night, everyone!
